 6
Write a query that displays the employee number and name of all
employees who work in a department with any employee whose name
contains 'R'. (Nested Sub Query)
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------
sql> SELECT EMPNO, ENAME
     FROM EMP
     WHERE DEPTNO IN
     (
         SELECT DEPTNO
         FROM EMP
         WHERE ENAME LIKE '%R%'
     );

